  "priorExpiration": "2006-08-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1703.02 Written Records.\n\n(a) All persons shall keep a written record of all individual transfers of all birds in the state customarily used as household pets.\n\n(b) The record shall include the following information:\n\n(1) Date of transfer;\n\n(2) Name and address of transferee; and\n\n(3) Species and number of birds.\n\nSource. #6832, eff 8-25-98, EXPIRED: 8-25-06\n\nNew. #8763, eff 11-22-06; ss by #10834, eff 5-21-15 (formerly Agr 1701.03); ss by #14164, eff 12-31-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1700.html"
